flowchart LR
    %% a remote ctl call from a connected local Crystalline
    local[Local crystalline] -->|"POST /api/v1/ctl"| route[remote_ctl route]
    route --> bearer[mcp_gate::resolve_bearer]
    bearer -->|no token| refuse[Refused: no anonymous ctl]
    bearer -->|token| scope[Scope::User of the token]
    scope --> allow{In REMOTE_COMMANDS?}
    allow -->|no| notRemote[NOT_REMOTE]
    allow -->|tool| remoteTool[McpServer::remote_tool]
    allow -->|other| dispatch[Remote dispatcher]
    remoteTool & dispatch --> reply["Envelope: v, ok, data or error"]
